          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok gutimo akwaya jabu me lalukana maleŋ ki jabu ma giliyo maber, gigoro kome macalo agora i kom agit ni, “Maleŋ pi Rwot.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gutweyo tol ma bulu i kome wek gitwe girid kwede i kom kitambara adwala me wic-ci; macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yam gutyeko tic i kom kema, en kema me rwatte, kit meno; jo Icrael gutyeko tic ducu macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses; gutimo kit meno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gukelo kema bot Moses, kema ki jami ticce ducu, lwak golle ki gutine ki riine wirre ki tedi tergi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "laa nyogi romi ma ginyoŋo, kicika me laumme; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "canduk lok me caden, ki tal latiŋŋe, ki kom me kica; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meja ki jami ticce ducu, ki mugati me aketa i nyim Lubaŋa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okar-mac me jabu ma giliyo maber, ki lwak laputte ma giketo malo i wiye, ki jami ticce ducu, ki moo me mac; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ke no tyer me jabu, moo me wir, ki odok eceta ma ŋwece kur, ki boŋo laum doggola me kema; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "keno tyer me mola, ki tal latiŋŋe, ki jami ticce ducu; otako lwok ki tedi tere; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "boŋo cuka me aŋaba me rumo dyekal, wirre ki tedi tergi ki boŋo laum doggaŋ me d yekal, ki lwak tol lacikgi ki lwak teke lagurgi; jami me tic kwedgi i kema, pi kema me rwatte; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ki boŋŋi aruka ma gitiyo mabeco me tic i kabedo maleŋ, bomji aruka maleŋ pi ajwaka Aron, ki boŋŋi aruka pi awobene pi ticgi me bedo ajwagi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Macalo Rwot ociko ki Moses, jo Icrael gutiyo gutyeko tic ducu kit meno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 39:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moses oneno tic ducu, ci nen, gutiyo tic kikome; macalo Rwot onoŋo ociko, gutiyo tic ducu kakare. Ci Moses olamo gum i komgi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.39.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.39.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
